py to call `register_resources(mcp)` during init\n32: - [x] Remove conditional example tool import bloat\n33: \n34: ### 1.4 Update tests\n35: - [x] Update `mcp_server_factory` for deferred registration pattern\n36: - [x] Update tool registration tests\n37: - [x] Verify no test contamination\n38: \n39: ## Phase 2: Discovery Tools\n40: \n41: ### 2.1 Implement list_tools\n42: - [x] Create `list_tools` tool that queries tool registry\n43: - [x] Return tool names, descriptions, and argument schemas\n44: - [x] Follow Result pattern\n45: \n46: ### 2.2 Implement list_prompts\n47: - [x] Create `list_prompts` tool that queries prompt registry\n48: - [x] Return prompt names and descriptions\n49: - [x] Follow Result pattern\n50: \n51: ### 2.3 Implement list_resources\n52: - [x] Create `list_resources` tool that queries resource registry\n53: - [x] Return resource URI patterns and descriptions\n54: - [x] Follow Result pattern\n55: \n56: ### 2.4 Add tests\n57: - [x] Test list_tools returns all registered tools\n58: - [x] Test list_prompts returns registered prompts\n59: - [x] Test list_resources returns registered resources\n60: - [x] Integration tests for discovery tools\n61: \n62: ## Phase 3: Documentation\n63: - [x] Add README.md documenting deferred registration pattern for AI consumption","content_truncated":false,"path":"openspec/changes/archive/2026-02-10-add-mcp-discovery/tasks.md","repository":"deeprave/mcp-guide","returned_lines":[1,63],"sha256":"73eb4fdc8d1f25b09b04ba6a8bef3c4dbb90d583b02c1d100b3649e3e0a88c53","status":"found","total_lines":63},"round":1}
